{title: Stand by Me}
{artist: Charles Albert Tindley}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 72}

Verse 1
When the [F]storms of life are raging, [Bb]stand by [F]me;
when the storms of life are raging, [C]stand by me.
When the [F]world is tossing me like a [Bb]ship upon the sea,
[F]thou who rulest wind and water, [C]stand by [F]me.
